@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://www.semanticweb.org/efliao/ontologies/2026/10/mm-ontology-schema-tasks> a owl:Ontology ;
